planned.evidence:
Every part the design names is in the tree:
- the adminRoutes row and adminFeedbackReply in the designed order;
- OwnerReplyTarget, and OwnerReply as a single INSERT…SELECT;
- Message.Replies filled by OwnerInbox;
- Sent and Reply with no id;
- SenderThreads;
- readerData.OwnFeedback, set only for a signed-in non-owner on stateFound, with an error giving 503;
- the reply form and replies in each admin feedback-<n> article;
- <ol class="own-feedback"> after the form.

There is no new migration. Cases (a)-(m) each have a passing test, the finish test exits 0, and seven independent mutants were all caught. Two declared deviations remain: OwnerReply returns only an error, and the <ol> sits after the hidden sent note rather than directly after </form>. Neither changes any case.
